			"notes": "- New: Minecraft 26.3 support (glint tint rebuilt for 26.3's new glint shaders).\n- Fixed: text fields and shortcuts in the settings screen on 26.3.\n- 1.21.11 now tints held and GUI items too.\n- Held shield and trident glint now take your tint on 26.1.2 – 26.3. Known limit: a held shield on 1.21.11 keeps the default glint colour.\n- Jars: 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2, 26.3.\n\n---\n**Pre-release.** Passed automated in-game tests (client gametests with a full mixin audit + a launch of every built jar into a world) on each listed Minecraft version. A hands-on playtest is still pending — please report anything odd in Issues."
		},
