			"notes": "First release — Glint Everything for Minecraft 1.21.11 and 26.1.x (Fabric, client-side).\n\n- Whitelist any item to give it the enchantment glint (live id suggestions)\n- Recolor the glint globally, for whitelisted items, or per item (hex / RGB / presets)\n- Animation control: speed, size, angle + Classic/Reverse/Vertical/Horizontal/Frozen motion\n- Vanilla & modded glint can be left alone, tinted, or hidden\n- Animated flat settings UI (ModMenu or keybind); honors vanilla Glint Speed/Strength accessibility options\n\nPick the jar matching your Minecraft version."
